# Visual design

When changing appearance, layout, colour, type, or motion of extension UI, follow [docs/design.md](docs/design.md).

- Use existing colour and spacing tokens. Do not add one-off hex, font stacks, or animation timings.
- If a visual choice is not in that doc, add it there first, then implement.
- Overlay stays transparent, non-interactive, top-right: Stream + Run counts plus a session/last-death header.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for any new animation.
